        "text": "=Analyze the content below and generate a structured, concise report.\n\nCONTENT:\n{{$json.content}}\n\nTASK:\n1. Summarize the key points in 3–5 bullet points.\n2. Identify any mentioned smartphone brands (e.g., Apple, Samsung, Xiaomi, Huawei, Oppo).\n3. Extract insights related to:\n   - Market share\n   - Sales performance\n   - Product launches\n   - Competitive positioning\n4. Identify any trends (growth, decline, innovation, pricing, regional shifts).\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT):\n\nSummary:\n• ...\n• ...\n\nCompanies Mentioned:\n• Company – Insight\n\nMarket Insights:\n• ...\n\nTrends:\n• ...\n\nRULES:\n- Be concise and factual\n- Do NOT repeat the input text\n- If no data is available for a section, write \"Not mentioned\"",
        "options": {}
